280	    /**
281	     * Whether this owner has been soft-deleted. A newly created owner is {@code false}; the
282	     * {@code DELETE /api/owners/{id}} endpoint flags it {@code true} while retaining the record, and
283	     * the create endpoint's duplicate and identity checks ignore owners flagged deleted. Treated as
284	     * {@code false} when {@code null} (owners persisted before the column existed).
285	     */
