932	    /**
933	     * Rolls a registration date forward to a business day. A date that falls on a Saturday, a Sunday
934	     * or a listed {@linkplain #PUBLIC_HOLIDAYS public holiday} is rolled forward one day at a time
935	     * until it reaches the next non-holiday weekday; a date already on a non-holiday weekday is
936	     * returned unchanged. This applies to the effective registration date whether it was supplied in
937	     * the request or defaulted to the server date, and the adjusted value is what gets stored as
938	     * {@code registrationDate} and feeds every value derived from it (such as the member id's
939	     * fiscal-year segment and the daily create-limit's per-day bucket).
940	     *
